OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry night
OL,6,Fahead with plenty of clear spells.
OL,7,FTemperatures will fall sharply
OL,8,Fovernight, beneath the long clear
OL,9,Fspells as winds ease. A widespread
OL,10,Ffrost is expected, particularly severe
OL,11,Fin sheltered valleys.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FA cloudy start in the
OL,14,Fnorthwest, where there will be a few
OL,15,Fscattered showers throughout the day.
OL,16,FDry and sunny in the south and further
OL,17,Feast. Another chilly day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
