OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fbut dry on Saturday, with a brisk
OL,7,Fcoastal breeze. Then a mix of bright
OL,8,Fspells and showers throughout Sunday.
OL,9,FRemaining cloudy on Monday, though
OL,10,Fwith fewer showers.
